\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces Frontier LLM-vs-ML comparison (May 2025, 26 LLMs $+$ 4 ML). (a) AUC ranking: reasoning-tuned ZS LLMs (Claude 4 Opus, o3, Gemini 2.5 Pro, DeepSeek-R1) cluster around 0.67--0.69, with FT GPT-4.1-mini reaching 0.722 -- statistical parity with Random Forest. (b) Brier calibration. (c) Net recovery (HKD M): Logistic Regression keeps a $\sim $28\% lead over the best LLM. (d) AUC--ROI Pareto frontier: the upper-right quadrant remains ML-only because LLMs over-treat borderline accounts. Red = LLM/AI; blue = ML.}}{18}{figure.caption.14}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:llm_compare}{{7}{18}{Frontier LLM-vs-ML comparison (May 2025, 26 LLMs $+$ 4 ML). (a) AUC ranking: reasoning-tuned ZS LLMs (Claude 4 Opus, o3, Gemini 2.5 Pro, DeepSeek-R1) cluster around 0.67--0.69, with FT GPT-4.1-mini reaching 0.722 -- statistical parity with Random Forest. (b) Brier calibration. (c) Net recovery (HKD M): Logistic Regression keeps a $\sim $28\% lead over the best LLM. (d) AUC--ROI Pareto frontier: the upper-right quadrant remains ML-only because LLMs over-treat borderline accounts. Red = LLM/AI; blue = ML}{figure.caption.14}{}}
