\newlabel{fig:llm_cost}{{8}{19}{Operational comparison vs.\ frontier LLMs. Left: capability radar (AUC, calibration, latency, cost, explainability). Right: cost--latency analysis at 16K-account portfolio scale. ML dominates on speed, cost, and explainability; the reasoning-LLM tier closes some discrimination gap but does not change operational economics}{figure.caption.15}{}}
